# Godiva Device OpenSCAD - Print Test

## Print Generation

```print, log=output/godiva-print.log
// Godiva Device Test
module test_core() {
    cube([150, 100, 50]);
}

module test_housing() {
    difference() {
        cube([165, 115, 70]);
        translate([2.5, 2.5, 2.5])
            cube([160, 110, 67]);
    }
}

module test_panel() {
    difference() {
        cube([100, 60, 3]);
        translate([10, 10, -1])
            cylinder(h=5, d=12);
    }
}

test_core();
translate([170, 0, 0]) test_housing();
translate([340, 0, 0]) test_panel();
```
